WEBVTT

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:54.920
Go now.

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:17.880
That's right... today is...

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.130
Oh crap! Kippei!

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:23.880
Kakeru.

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:25.330
What's up?

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:29.460
I've kept it a secret this whole time,
but I actually have a super power.

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:30.460
Huh?!

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:34.790
The instant that I wake up I can foresee...
whether I'll be late or not.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.000
Anybody can do that!

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.880
C'mon, it's time to get up.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.580
Nuh-uh! I dun wanna!

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:44.290
You know what today is, right? It's our field trip!

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.170
Are you seriously gonna go?

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:52.500
You realize that not going would just draw unwanted
attention. Like from parents and teachers.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:58.670
Wake up!

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:24.790
"I just don't care anymore"

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:27.580
A reply thrown out

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:32.380
Briefly blooming then briefly falling, over and over

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.920
Left feeling unsatisfied

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:38.830
Yes, day by day, I walked on

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:41.130
Cry, futurity, gloomy

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:45.130
The twilight still out of reach

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:47.500
Don't lose your way

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:50.710
Tighten the twine of dreams

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.130
Take me so high

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:55.960
Start running to a brand new life

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:58.460
Everything I have in my hand

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:02.130
Holding onto seven colors

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:04.000
Go ahead, make my day

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:07.380
I'll use this fist to rebel even harder!

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.830
Everything I have in my hand

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:13.580
Sketching ideals and hopes

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:15.170
I won't let you down

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:18.460
I'll let this flower bloom forever!

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:22.130
Believe myself

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:34.040
<b>Hope</b>

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:48.920
<b>GUT</b>

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:48.920
<b>BUSTER</b>

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:45.880
Go full speed and we can make it!

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.920
Why don't we take it easy and save our energy?

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:50.880
You know, for the future!

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:52.830
Good idea.

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:00.460
Excuse me.

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:05.250
I was told to follow the arrows
on here to get to my destination.

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:09.630
So, uh... am I supposed to open this?

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.750
It's not pointing down, it's telling you to go that way.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.000
Oh!

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.540
Thank you!

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:32.250
Oh boy...

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:36.830
Wait! Listen to me dude, it's always a trap
whenever girls strike up conversation!

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:38.920
It'll be okay.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:46.080
Sorry to bother you. I'm trying to find
the TV tower, can you help me out?

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:47.210
Sure!

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:48.830
Kakeru!

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:51.210
Sorry, man! Answer roll call for me!

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:54.580
He's asking for trouble.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.170
<b>Nagoya City Museum</b>

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:01.250
Kakeru! Is Kakeru Miwa here?

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:02.750
Sure am!

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:05.710
No jokes.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.080
He's not here yet.

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.540
So he's absent then.

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:15.040
I guess I shouldn't be surprised...

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:18.880
<b>Nagoya City Museum Special Exhibit</b>

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:18.880
<b>Obara: The Path To Recovery</b>

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:23.000
Man, I wanted to see the real thing.
They should've just left it as is.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.000
That would be the opposite of rebuilding...

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:32.130
Hey Miya!

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:34.830
What's this model?

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:36.000
Hi!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:40.540
This is the model of Obara after the incident 8 years ago.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:44.830
Oh wow... that was pretty bad, wasn't it?

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:46.420
Thanks Miya!

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:49.170
Anytime! Let me know if you need me again!

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.960
Hanjo! Hanjo!

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:52.710
Hanjo! Miya!

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:58.420
Did you know?

00:06:58.670 --> 00:06:59.500
Huh?

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.540
Rumor is that a UFO was behind all of this.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:05.710
I actually heard that it was the work of Oni.

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:06.880
Huh?!

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:10.170
It was a trap!

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:13.540
You're funny! Oni are, like, the stuff of fairy tales.

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:20.500
Oh! There's the TV tower!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.420
It's really right where the phone said!

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:25.500
Glad you found it. Well, bye then!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:27.250
Excuse me!

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:28.330
Huh?

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:30.130
Thank you for your help.

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:32.130
I would have been lost without you!

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:35.750
Good luck getting used to your phone!

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:36.670
Bye!

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.630
Thanks! I'll figure it out!

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:41.880
Lady Oka.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:46.080
You're late again, princess.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:48.790
You should have called, we would have escorted you.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:52.790
I appreciate you waiting for me. Sorry to keep you.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:55.420
Now we have everyone together, right?

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:58.130
Then we should get started.

00:07:58.710 --> 00:07:59.710
Move out.

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:00.500
Okay.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.330
Time to get down to business!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.420
<b>Nagoya City Museum Special Exhibit</b>

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.420
<b>Obara: The Path To Recovery</b>

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:22.670
I know I'm in the right place...

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:26.290
Where is everybody? Did they already leave?

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:45.670
I've found them!

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.960
You're so lucky.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:48.960
Huh?!

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:56.380
Being the only damn survivor.

00:08:57.710 --> 00:08:59.170
Why did it have to be you?

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:03.710
Who are you?!

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.290
Is your life even worth anything?

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:17.630
Snappity snap.

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:20.960
Betcha this one will go viral!

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.710
Someone else should have survived.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.420
What can you even do?

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.880
You're totally worthless.

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:34.080
I already know! I hate the fact that I survived!

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.080
Oh yeah?

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:37.580
Well...

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:42.130
you won't mind letting somebody else
take your place then!

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:56.830
The girl who can't use a smartphone?!

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:59.210
I just put it to good use! Come this way!

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:03.130
Lady Oka!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.670
I remember you...

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.330
Stand back.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.460
What are those things?! And who're you guys?!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.830
I am so lost right now!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:50.830
Huh?

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:53.080
What's he all mad about?

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:55.290
He seems disoriented.

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:57.000
What a hassle.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:01.290
Let me go!

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:04.580
We can handle things over here!

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:06.000
Let's go, Haruko!

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:06.830
Right!

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:08.960
Put me down already!

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.880
Don't throw away your life so willingly.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:17.250
What?!

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.330
Where did you people even come from?!

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:23.040
Tell me, is history repeating itself...?

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.420
This is your fault.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.380
You were targeted because you lack self-esteem.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:32.290
A few seconds later and those things
would have made lunch out of you.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.830
How am I supposed to know!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.790
You don't need to know anything. Keep out of this.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:39.880
Just stay here and be quiet.

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:41.420
Got it?

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:49.670
Easy peasy!

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:00.630
That's the last of them.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:02.830
Please work your magic.

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:03.540
Sure.

00:12:04.210 --> 00:12:05.790
I'll seal the nether realm shut.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:20.750
Leave here and return from whence you came.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:34.880
They're still here! I can't seal it off!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:47.750
Lady Oka!

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.000
Lady Oka!

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:04.170
Dammit!

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:12.920
Up you go!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.500
Where am I now?

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:58.670
Stay away!

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:11.750
Not the typical little wimp, are ya?

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:13.710
It talks!

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:17.960
Life's a helluva lot easier if you let
an Oni take over your body.

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:20.290
But you're feeling ticked off, yeah?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:23.210
Trust me when I say, I can totally relate!

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:26.920
Listen, kid. There's only two ways out of this.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:32.880
Get devoured by the Oni and kiss the shitastic life
that you've been leading goodbye.

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:38.330
Or obtain real power and graduate from being
the worthless, weak piece of shit you are now.

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:41.210
Go on... choose!

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:44.380
Salvation! Or power!

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:52.920
Shikizakura!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.170
Shikizakura!

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:03.330
Not good, not good! These Oni are hella hyper right now!

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.130
Hey! Somebody head for the basement!

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:10.080
My hands are full!

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:12.130
Haruko here! I'm on it!

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:14.420
Haruko?!

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:16.920
What's wrong? Come in, Haruko!

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:21.290
Something just flew past me and headed your way!
Please be careful!

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:22.580
What kind of something?!

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:25.920
Look out!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.000
Wait, that's...

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:45.920
Why is it here?!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:08.630
Seriously?!

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:13.500
That was too close.

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:15.830
Kaede! Are you okay?

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:16.580
Haruko!

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:29.080
I really hope that's not who I think it is...

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:35.080
Pathetic! These things are weaker than worms!

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:37.380
That must be the one who interferred
with your enchantment.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:39.250
Wait! There's a person inside of that suit!

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:41.920
Not anymore! That's an Oni.

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:44.460
And Oni... must be slayed!

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:48.290
Sounds like fun. I'd love to see you try.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:49.920
COME AND GET IT!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.130
Ryo!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.330
The shrine maiden!

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:14.630
Today really is my lucky day!

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:20.460
STOOOP!

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:23.960
She's one of the good guys!

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:25.670
Stay the hell out of this!

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:29.630
No way! I'm not letting you use
my body to create anymore chaos!

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:33.670
Oni were born to create chaos, fool!

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:36.830
Please... hurry and run away.

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:39.580
Go to sleep, twerp.

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:40.790
Stop!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.880
Free that boy right now.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.630
Kiss my ass!

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:57.920
You have her eyes.

00:17:57.920 --> 00:18:01.330
I can never forget them. Those are the eyes
of the woman who imprisoned me.

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:06.080
I've been waiting for this moment... for so damn long!

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:09.460
I'm going to wring your neck until it snaps like a twig!

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:14.040
Too busy pissing yourself to talk?

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:16.830
I do not fear you in the least.

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:18.380
Huh?

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.630
I've been prepared to face my death for ages.

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:23.830
Just let the boy go!

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:26.380
Fearless, huh?

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.420
Well, thanks for making it easy!

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:34.330
You can't!

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:37.130
You're pissing me off, twerp!

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:38.750
I'll never let you get away with this!

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:42.880
You little shit!

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:47.830
I've had enough of your damn whining, twerp!

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:52.750
Shut up and throw in the towel
if you know what's good for you!

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:54.460
Screw you!

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:58.830
You talk big for a wimp who can't do jack squat!

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:02.250
I've changed! I'm not helpless like I used to be!

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.210
I'm going use this power to save people!

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:06.420
All of them!

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:09.330
Enough of your bullshit!

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:11.330
I'm dead serious!

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.710
I could never make sense of it.

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.670
I was spared on that day. But what for?

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:19.960
<b>Obara: The Path to Recovery</b>

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:19.960
<b>The Lone Survivor</b>

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:24.000
Now I know!

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:27.380
I... am going...

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:30.790
to be a hero!

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:40.210
If you ask me... life has no meaning... at all...

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:56.920
Thank you.

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:01.130
<b>Nagoya City Museum</b>

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:08.790
Rise and shine, Kakeru Miwa.

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:10.130
Huh?

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:13.630
You really helped out back there. Thank you.

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:17.250
So, Kakeru. We'd like you to come with us.

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:20.250
For real? Is this an invite to join you?!

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:24.330
The reason I survived...

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:29.210
Sure thing! I'll gladly be a hero!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:33.880
Huh?!

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:35.960
I'm afraid you've gotten the wrong impression.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.880
For starters, we're not superheroes.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.000
And you are too much of a threat.

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:43.040
Hold up!

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:47.330
Please don't waste time trying to escape.

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:49.290
Hurry and stand up already!

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:52.380
It really was a trap!

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:11.250
I hope that this moment never ends

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:15.250
I hope that it continues for decades to come

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:21.670
Becoming unable to even wear pretty outfits

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:26.170
In a world where only I have passed on

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:30.420
The cider I disliked that day

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:32.630
The cry of the missing cicadas

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:34.960
Drowning into fate

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:38.040
Not knowing how to struggle

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:42.880
It's almost as if I'm invisible to everyone

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:46.710
I don't even feel the urge to resist

00:21:48.170 --> 00:21:52.580
After you helped pulled me along

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:56.380
I saw the beautiful colors of the world

00:21:56.380 --> 00:21:58.920
In the season of blooming cherry blossoms

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:03.130
Captivated by that innocent smile

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:07.170
There is nothing that can't be changed

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:11.210
And that's true of any sad future too, right?

00:22:23.130 --> 00:22:25.630
<b>Nagoya City Museum</b>

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:27.790
Anybody up for karoke after this?

00:22:27.790 --> 00:22:28.790
Totally!

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:34.920
Kakeru never showed up after all.

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:38.380
What is this button for, Kakeru?

00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:39.330
That's for airplane mode.

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:40.250
How about this?

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:44.000
That's your wi-fi connection. And next to that is the
button to set up your own personal hotspot.

00:22:43.580 --> 00:22:45.380
U-uh, Kakeru?

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:45.580
Next to that you have the camera button,

00:22:45.580 --> 00:22:48.540
and this one is for orientation lock,
and you can place calls with this one...

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.040
<b>United Front</b>

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:48.210
The next episode is "United Front"! Ugh!

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:49.380
Ouch!

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:50.790
Come on, you're not supposed to throw it!
